{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>英國王儲伉儷威廉和凱特周一（16日）抵達印度孟買，出席兩夫婦成立的「為地球奮鬥獎」（Earthshot Prize）頒獎典禮，今次是他們近4年來首次海外訪問。在孟買期間，威廉和凱特更與當地年輕人一起在街頭玩板球，互相攻防切磋球技。二人將在印度停留3日，將前往首都新德里，與印度總理莫迪見面。（法新社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.675863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:35:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:11:13.558598+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:35.809502+00:00","content_hash":"4fc8e7e4c43b3076ecdd71a9b544a5fd560a0eaf80e83d43f29503da74ee8b40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}